    "## CosMx \n",
    "We will start the quantitative analysis with CosMx data:\n",
    "    - (1) Run gridgene pipeline\n",
    "    - (2) Fetch IF correspondending images, preprocessing and creation of masks. \n",
    "    - (3) Analyse quantitatively the overlay between gridgene and IF masks. \n",
    "    - (4) Fetch cell segmentation (done with Baysor - https://doi.org/10.1038/s41587-021-01044-w) and phenotyping.\n",
    "To run the analysis more smoothly we will select 3 images from the CosMx cohort. Importantly, the overlay between both images would depend on the parametes used both in gridgen and the preprocessing of IF, meaning, depending on the degree of details, mas can become more smooth or more fine grained."
   ]
  },
